OL,3,GNEWSAWhat are the Isle of Man
OL,4,Agovernment's priorities?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCutting healthcare waiting lists and
OL,7,Fmaking homes easier to afford are among
OL,8,Fthe eight priorities set out by the
OL,9,FIsle of Man Government.
OL,11,FIts Charter for Change, introduced by
OL,12,FChief Minister Chris Thomas, said
OL,13,Fministers would be focusing on "fewer
OL,14,Fthings - so that they get done".
OL,16,FHe also said the government was "too
OL,17,Fbig, too complicated and too slow in
OL,18,Ftoo many places".
