OL,3,GNEWSAWhat are the Isle of Man
OL,4,Agovernment's priorities?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe priorities come under three core
OL,7,Faims, to achieve a stronger economy, a
OL,8,Fsafer community and a better-connected
OL,9,FIsland.
